  "description": "A complete managed C# reimplementation of curl and libcurl for .NET 10: no native libcurl, native-AOT ready, behaves like curl 8.22.0. The .NET programming interface to Curl: an async client over the managed curl engine, with HttpClient-shaped ergonomics and curl's own options. Libcurl is for porting C or libcurl code to .NET: the libcurl API one call for one call; Curl.Api is for new .NET work: an async, HttpClient-shaped client.",
